# #5 — Cegah node_modules/.git/.env/uploads masuk ke Docker context
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.dockerignore
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.parcel-cache

# Env & secrets — jangan pernah masuk image
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Uploads/backups/logs — data runtime
**/uploads
**/backups
**/logs
**/*.log
**/tmp
**/.tmp*

# OS/IDE
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.claude
**/.cursor
**/.worktrees
**/.playwright-mcp
